VALUES (37, 1, 'Orofer XT', 'Ferrous Ascorbate and Folic Acid Tablets IP', 'Hematinic (Iron Supplement)', 'Emcure Pharmaceuticals', 'Tablet', '100mg + 1.5mg', '[{"name": "Ferrous Ascorbate eq. to Elemental Iron", "strength": "100", "unit": "mg", "purpose": "Hematinic"}, {"name": "Folic Acid IP", "strength": "1.5", "unit": "mg", "purpose": "Hematopoiesis"}]', '["Microcrystalline Cellulose", "Starch", "Povidone", "Magnesium Stearate", "Purified Talc"]', 'Round biconvex', 'White', 'None', 'Film-coated', 'Iron deficiency anemia, pregnancy nutritional support.', 'Take 1 tablet daily after food. May turn stools dark.', 'Take only as directed by your physician or pharmacist. Keep out of reach of children.', 'Consult package leaflet for full clinical side effects list.', 'Store below 25°C.', 'OTC', 'Orofer XT, generic Ferrous Ascorbate and Folic Acid Tablets IP 100mg + 1.5mg. Used for Iron deficiency anemia, pregnancy nutritional support.. Take 1 tablet daily after food. May turn stools dark.', 'Orofer XT, जेनेरिक Ferrous Ascorbate and Folic Acid Tablets IP 100mg + 1.5mg। Iron deficiency anemia, pregnancy nutritional support.। खुराक: Take 1 tablet daily after food. May turn stools dark.।', 'Orofer XT, जेनेरिक औषध Ferrous Ascorbate and Folic Acid Tablets IP 100mg + 1.5mg. Iron deficiency anemia, pregnancy nutritional support.. डोस: Take 1 tablet daily after food. May turn stools dark..', 'active')
